// <auto-generated>ANG moment 4: a chokehold from behind, one paired scene. Presentation only.</auto-generated>
// Go has decided everything when the events arrive: how long it was held, on which second the body went limp, how it ended. This file plays it on the two bodies:
// the forearm across the throat on the victim's real neck, his hands clawing at that forearm until the strength leaves them, the limp body carried down; or the arm torn off and both apart.
// The struggle lasts what the server says, the clip is warped to it. Past the limp second a long hold waits on one pose, its seconds shown faster. Numbers: world.combat_look.choke.
